// The accuracy axis's own find, and Honed's opposite number: Honed splits
// itself between damage and aim, this spends the whole roll on aim and so
// sits at the axis's calibration ceiling. Weapon-only, because a weapon is
// what a program points at something.
(
    id: "zeroed",
    prefix: Some("Zeroed"),
    stats: (accuracy: 3),
    slots: Some([Weapon]),
    weight: 10,
)
